[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    183[0m:[38;5;10m[49m                 0,
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    184[0m:[38;5;10m[49m                 "byte1 xor {diff:#04x} must reject: h1={h1:02x?} h2={h2:02x?}"
